{"channelId":"UCc5e7luIhcMuZ6MZ8ltSEEg","row":["Vafa Animal Shelter",2480,"Vafa is the first animal shelter in Iran that was founded in 2003 by Fatemeh Motamedi to take care of dogs who were sick or needed care. Before that, there was sadly no such institution in Iran. \nVafa is a charitable NGO, run by grassroots donations. It runs two animal shelters in Hashtgerd and Qazvin, housing more than 1800 dogs.\nAs a non-for-profit charity, Vafa has no links to any political or religious organization.\nWe aim to build a better world where humans and animals co-exist.\nCultural and awareness work, aimed at gathering support for animals, is our main method.","info@vafashelter.com","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc5e7luIhcMuZ6MZ8ltSEEg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc5e7luIhcMuZ6MZ8ltSEEg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:54.454Z","channelId":"UCc5e7luIhcMuZ6MZ8ltSEEg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9eed037d336acbd56a66f8d680cc26b80cfdeeaf9d99f8e94316e434c2014983","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"0066a88cd079948431255df1acaca0e48e24b617a46e8ce71fa1ed952c1407c9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc5e7luIhcMuZ6MZ8ltSEEg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:02:59.694Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc5e7luIhcMuZ6MZ8ltSEEg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2480,"raw":"2.48K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc5e7luIhcMuZ6MZ8ltSEEg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:54.454Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@vafashelter.com","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://zil.ink/vafaanimalshelter"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:3ba492b6cbe0ab0212f44cd9"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:30:23.575Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"info@vafashelter.com","raw":"info@vafashelter.com"}],"contactPages":[],